Hi,

This is the 2.4 version of the patches updated to contain the same fixes
as the 2.5 version I posted the other day.

The patch extracts the OF functions into their own library, so that they
can be used by the PReP boot loader, and to minimize the size of each
bootloader.

Cheers,

Leigh.





